msgctxt "80"
msgid "What're ya gettin' at, Kiryu-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "I think I was pretty clear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Ya can't seriously want me goin' back to the Tojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "...I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Well too bad. Ain't much point in it now. Clan's just not the barrel o' "
"monkeys it used to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Listen, Majima-san. Daigo's taking over as sixth chairman,\r\n"
"but he could end up in some trouble without a family of\r\n"
"his own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Meanin' you want my muscle backing him up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Please. Your family's the only thing that can save\r\n"
"the Tojo Clan now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "...Gonna have to pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Majima-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"C'mon, Kiryu-chan. You know what I'm like. Livin' life caged\r\n"
"up like a damn shelter dog ain't my scene and you know it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"But that's exactly what I'm doing. Givin' up my freedom to\r\n"
"keep my family afloat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"But now you come marchin' up here asking me to babysit your\r\n"
"little protégé on top of that? Sorry, ain't gonna happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Somehow I knew that's what you'd say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Majima-san. You wanna be free, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "But instead you're feeling trapped. Cooped up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Well then this is the perfect chance for you to break out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Huh? The flyin' shit are you talkin' about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Once Daigo takes over, there'll be no shortage of people for\r\n"
"you to fight. You can go wild like you've never gone before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "How's that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"You can be his enforcer. Anyone even thinks about betraying\r\n"
"Daigo, you get full license to put them back in line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "You... sayin' what I think you're sayin', Kiryu-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"You bet. It's time Kamurocho sees what the Majima Family\r\n"
"can really do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"So I'm not asking you to babysit, Majima-san. I'm asking\r\n"
"you to let loose. Because the more ass you kick, the better\r\n"
"off the Tojo Clan, and Daigo, will be."
msgstr ""

